# Demo Effects Showcase
# Cycles through different CRT effect presets to demonstrate visual capabilities

# Start with clean slate
effect None
wait 2s

# Scanline effects
effect Light Scanlines
wait 5s

effect Heavy Scanlines
wait 5s

# Pixel effects
effect Pixel Grid
wait 5s

effect Chunky Pixels
wait 5s

# Blur and bloom
effect Soft Blur
wait 5s

effect Heavy Bloom
wait 5s

# Composite effects
effect Composite Blur
wait 5s

effect RGB Separation
wait 5s

# Classic CRT
effect Classic CRT
wait 5s

# Return to clean
effect None
wait 2s

stop
